{"4449420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Into the End (of the World)", "steam_appid": 4449420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>CHASSIS UP</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, modify, and maintain your survival machine. Every part is replaceable—until the world tears it away from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/5c9f90e84644649385799df6f3767f22.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/5c9f90e84644649385799df6f3767f22.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/5c9f90e84644649385799df6f3767f22.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>EVOLVED THREATS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not fighting mindless walkers. Face common hordes alongside <i><strong>Feral</strong></i><strong>, <i>Bloater</i>, <i>Trapper</i>, and <i>Corrupter</i></strong> mutations in full Online Co-Op.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feral</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/22d2e0301d516b84618e8d1e49ab68e3.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/22d2e0301d516b84618e8d1e49ab68e3.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/22d2e0301d516b84618e8d1e49ab68e3.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bloater</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/ae45cd9f0142bd996c5ddd9d3cc23406.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/ae45cd9f0142bd996c5ddd9d3cc23406.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/ae45cd9f0142bd996c5ddd9d3cc23406.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/1f76651b962040934009ebdc16958551.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/1f76651b962040934009ebdc16958551.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/1f76651b962040934009ebdc16958551.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corrupter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/3bb51a70894f3a2570b9e9ff39b0a7f3.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/3bb51a70894f3a2570b9e9ff39b0a7f3.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/3bb51a70894f3a2570b9e9ff39b0a7f3.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SHIFTING HORIZONS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to dynamic weather and conquer procedural biomes—from claustrophobic forests to dead deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></i></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Friendly Rides:</strong> Drive and customize modified, legendary car models adapted for a brutal world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Mechanics:</strong> Manage your fuel, monitor your dashboard, and replace everything from engine parts to tires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mutation Hierarchy:</strong> Fight through common hordes and adapt your tactics against <u><i>Feral</i></u><i>, <u>Bloater</u>, <u>Trapper</u>,</i> and <u><i>Corrupter</i></u> variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Exploration:</strong> Conquer ever-changing biomes, from claustrophobic forests to dead deserts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Adapt your driving physics to blinding rainstorms and unpredictable weather shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Online Co-Op:</strong> Form your crew, share resources, and watch each other's backs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>CHASSIS UP</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, modify, and maintain your survival machine. Every part is replaceable—until the world tears it away from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/5c9f90e84644649385799df6f3767f22.poster.avif?t=17868