06.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trapper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/1f76651b962040934009ebdc16958551.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/1f76651b962040934009ebdc16958551.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/1f76651b962040934009ebdc16958551.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Corrupter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/3bb51a70894f3a2570b9e9ff39b0a7f3.poster.avif?t=1786881990\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/3bb51a70894f3a2570b9e9ff39b0a7f3.webm?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/extras/3bb51a70894f3a2570b9e9ff39b0a7f3.mp4?t=1786881990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>SHIFTING HORIZONS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to dynamic weather and conquer procedural biomes—from claustrophobic forests to dead deserts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >______________________________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></i></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Friendly Rides:</strong> Drive and customize modified, legendary car models adapted for a brutal world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Mechanics:</strong> Manage your fuel, monitor your dashboard, and replace everything from engine parts to tires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mutation Hierarchy:</strong> Fight through common hordes and adapt your tactics against <u><i>Feral</i></u><i>, <u>Bloater</u>, <u>Trapper</u>,</i> and <u><i>Corrupter</i></u> variants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Exploration:</strong> Conquer ever-changing biomes, from claustrophobic forests to dead deserts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Adapt your driving physics to blinding rainstorms and unpredictable weather shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Online Co-Op:</strong> Form your crew, share resources, and watch each other's backs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Drive, maintain, and survive. Explore procedural biomes in a post-apocalyptic world, scavenge for parts, and fight infected zones with friends. Build your survival machine from the chassis up and keep it running - because without it, you won’t get far.", "supported_languages": "English, Turkish, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/02a52102cbb39a3f85ee15091ecc31f10e195db6/header.jpg?t=1786881990", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/3d27dee318ba43c8e6a14be30e6f1c784bdfc732/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786881990", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4449420/3d27dee318ba43c8e6a14be30e6f1c784bdfc732/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786881990", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 